B.eEP=new A.eo("pump","Water pump","\ud83d\udeb0",B.aH,"Pushes water round a pipe. Needs 2.5 to 9 volts. Works either way round.","A small motor spins a paddle wheel inside a sealed case and flings water out of the pipe.")
B.eEB=new A.eo("hairdryer","Hair dryer","\ud83d\udca8",B.hZ,"Blows warm air. A hungry gadget: it needs 6 to 13 volts and a strong battery. Works either way round.","A fan blows air past a hot coil of wire, the same coil idea as a toaster.")
B.eEN=new A.eo("headphones","Headphones","\ud83c\udfa7",B.bk,"Play music into your ears. They are quiet and need only 1.2 to 5 volts, so 9 volts would burn them. Use a step-down converter! The + dot goes to the battery +.","Two tiny speakers, one for each ear, shake the air with a coil and a thin cone.")
B.eE7=new A.eo("smartwatch","Apple Watch Ultra","\u231a",B.bv,"Shows the time and your heartbeat. It sips power: 3 to 4.5 volts only. Use a step-down converter on bigger batteries. The + dot goes to the battery +.","A tiny chip, a screen and a sensor that shines green light on your wrist to feel your pulse.")
