B.eDX=new A.eo("iphonefold","iPhone Fold","\ud83d\udcf1",B.b2,"A phone that opens like a book into a big screen. Needs 4 to 7 volts, so a 9 volt battery would burn it: use a step-down converter. The + dot goes to the battery +. Tap 3 times for the big phone, 4 times to make it bigger.","A bendable glass screen folds along a hinge made of tiny gears.")
B.eEa=new A.eo("galaxy","Samsung Galaxy S26 Ultra","\ud83d\udcf1",B.db,"A top Android phone with a huge flat screen and a punch-hole camera. Needs 4 to 7 volts: use a step-down converter on bigger batteries. The + dot goes to the battery +.","A bright AMOLED screen where each pixel makes its own light, with a titanium frame.")
