B.eEC=new A.eo("pixel","Google Pixel 10 Pro XL","\ud83d\udcf1",B.bi,"Google's top phone with a smart camera bar. Needs 4 to 7 volts: use a step-down converter. The + dot goes to the battery +.","A chip made for AI helps the camera and the phone understand what you need.")
