B.eED=new A.eo("honor","Honor Magic V5","\ud83d\udcf1",B.ct,"One of the thinnest foldable phones. Needs 4 to 7 volts: use a step-down converter. The + dot goes to the battery +.","A very thin hinge and a carbon-fibre frame keep it light even when it opens into a big screen.")
